sequenceDiagram
  participant Mobile
  participant API
  participant Route as Route State
  actor User
  Mobile->>API: Current location + accuracy
  API->>Route: Check progress, destination and entrance context
  Route-->>API: Proximity and route completion evidence
  API-->>Mobile: Candidate arrival state
  alt Proximity only or entrance ambiguous
    Mobile-->>User: Near destination, confirm entrance safely
    User->>Mobile: Confirm or continue
  else Sufficient route evidence
    Mobile-->>User: Arrival confirmation
  end
